  private static BigInteger num1(int n) {\n        if (n < 0) {\n            return BigInteger.ZERO;\n        }\n        if (n < 2) {\n            return BigInteger.ONE;\n        }\n        if (!tab1.containsKey(n)) {\n            BigInteger r = BigInteger.ZERO;\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                r = r.add(num1(i).multiply(num1(n - 1 - i)));\n            }\n            tab1.put(n, r);\n        }\n        return tab1.get(n);\n    }\n\n    private static BigInteger num2(int n, int h) {\n        if (n < 0 || h <= 0 || n >= (1 << (h - 1))) {\n            return BigInteger.ZERO;\n        }\n        if (n < 2) {\n            return BigInteger.ONE;\n        }\n        if (n < h) {\n            return num1(n);\n        }\n        Map<Integer, BigInteger> innerMap = tab2.get(n);\n        if (innerMap == null || !innerMap.containsKey(h)) {\n            BigInteger r = BigInteger.ZERO;\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                r = r.add(num2(i, h - 1).multiply(num2(n - 1 - i, h - 1)));\n            }\n            if (innerMap == null) {\n                innerMap = new HashMap<>();\n                tab2.put(n, innerMap);\n            }\n            innerMap.put(h, r);\n        }\n        return tab2.get(n).get(h);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = scanner.nextInt();\n        int h = scanner.nextInt();\n        scanner.close();\n\n        BigInteger result = num1(n).subtract(num2(n, h));\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n}\n```", "token_logprobs": [-0.09783133119344711, -2.1280031204223633, -1.1086402082582936e-05, -4.8040190449682996e-05, -0.00010311071673640981, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.3132949471473694, -2.777537883957848e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.00021073981770314276, -7.033323527139146e-06, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -3.564294092939235e-05, -0.027840105816721916, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.192092824453